| Accessible from | private | package-private | protected | public |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| same class | ✓ | ✓ | ✓ | ✓ |
| same package | ✗ | ✓ | ✓ | ✓ |
| subclass (other package) | ✗ | ✗ | ✓ | ✓ |
| unrelated, other package | ✗ | ✗ | ✗ | ✓ |
```java
class Account {
    private long balance = 0;                      // hidden
    public boolean withdraw(long a) {              // the only way down
        if (a <= 0 || a > balance) return false;   // invariant: balance >= 0
        balance -= a; return true;
    }
    public long getBalance() { return balance; }
}
